  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-subagent-output-sanitizer",
      "text": "Version 0.1.5 requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.3 or a compatible host. See [compatibility details](docs/dsh-0.2-compatibility.md).\n\n清理子代理消息中的孤立工具块。\n\n在 `agent/created` 完成进入会话后，通过公开 `sessionQuery.readSurface` 一次读取当前模型可见事件，并持久替换不安全的子代理投递。异步读取期间已替换的节点不会恢复；读取失败会中止该次创建。步骤前清洗继续保留，不写入会话创建通知阶段，也不使用已移除的 `session.events`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "锁定公开仓库的提交后，通过 DSH 官方入口安装：\n\n```powershell\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:vb2250158/dsh-subagent-output-sanitizer#<commit>\n```\n\n插件包声明 `dsh.bundle`，安装后会把自己的配置层加入 profile。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "插件配置保存在 DSH profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml`。多电脑同步仓库只保存仓库地址、固定提交、启停状态和配置，不保存本仓库源码。"
    },
    {
      "section": "验证",
      "text": "```powershell\nnpm test\nnpm pack --dry-run\n```\n\nRun the source-based rc.3 lifecycle check with `DSH_SOURCE_ROOT=<checkout> node --test tests/session-lifecycle.rc3.integration.mjs`. It covers the real SessionStore announcement, exact surface query, durable replacement and repeated creation notification."
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin display metadata",
      "text": "The plugin list shows **Subagent output cleanup** in English and **子代理输出清理** in Chinese, following the DSH interface language. `locale/en.json` and `locale/zh.json` provide the title and description; `icon.svg` supplies self-contained artwork. The package exports and publishes these resources. The icon is adapted from Lucide; see [ICON_LICENSE.txt](ICON_LICENSE.txt).\n\nThe icon uses a centered 36 × 36 viewBox to leave more space around the artwork inside the plugin icon frame."
    }
  ],
